    {
      "source": "Disabled by default; subclasses can override this to enable ID generation.\nNote that this flag is about <i>always</i> generating an ID; the parser\nwon't even check for an \"id\" attribute in this case.",
      "translation": "默认禁用；子类可以重写此设置以启用 ID 生成。请注意，此标志是关于<i>始终</i>生成 ID；在这种情况下，解析器甚至不会检查\"id\"属性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation delegates to the <code>doParse</code>\nversion without ParserContext argument.",
      "translation": "默认实现会委托给不带 ParserContext 参数的<code>doParse</code>版本。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
